menu "Unified BSP Demo Configuration"

    config DEMO_DEBUG_BYPASS_PROV
        bool "Bypass Provisioning & Force Live Telemetry Dashboard (Debug Mode)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled (or when the BOOT button is held down at power-up),
            the firmware skips BLE provisioning and claiming token flows,
            and boots directly into the active telemetry dashboard with live sensor polling.

    config DEMO_DEBUG_DISABLE_DEEP_SLEEP
        bool "Disable Deep Sleep in Debug Mode (Continuous Bench Testing)"
        default y
        help
            Keeps the ESP32-S3 awake continuously during debug/testing mode so you can
            test touch interaction and live sensor polling without entering deep sleep.

    choice DEMO_SLEEP_MODE
        prompt "Telemetry Sleep Architecture"
        default DEMO_SLEEP_MODE_LIGHT
        help
            Select the default sleep architecture for the telemetry node.
            Can also be overridden dynamically via ThingsBoard shared attribute "sleep_mode".

        config DEMO_SLEEP_MODE_LIGHT
            bool "Light Sleep (Zero re-init, resumes execution on same line)"
            help
                Retains CPU state, FreeRTOS tasks, and all RAM in memory.
                Wakes instantly at the exact line of code without resetting or reinitializing.

        config DEMO_SLEEP_MODE_DEEP
            bool "Deep Sleep (Ultra-low power with Fast-Wake path)"
            help
                Powers down the CPU and digital core (~10uA). Wakes via fast-boot
                path skipping audio, SD, and unneeded peripheral initialization.
    endchoice

endmenu
